# Aether Union-Find — Hardware Mapping Notes

**Status:** M15–M69 + **M70** PE coloring (`Docs/Helios_n_Coloring_M70`). No Vivado bitstream / no Stim Helios-n grow RTL.  
**Last updated:** 2026-08-26 (M70 coloring)  
