## 5. Recommended Aether PE / memory map (implementation checklist)

Do not start RTL until each checkbox has a co-sim plan against `cargo test` + Stim shots.

| ID | Item | Decision |
| --- | --- | --- |
| H1 | PE granularity | 1 PE per `NodeId` after DEM compile (detectors + virtual boundaries). **M34:** PE-pair RTL. **M37:** edge-list mesh. **M42–M47:** Stim PE-mesh through phenom + circuit d=3 r=3 grow→peel. |
| H2 | Edge owner for `growth` | Helios rule: store on **lower** endpoint id; atomic +1 from odd/active sides. **M34:** `owns_edge = MY_ID < neigh_id`. **M37/M42:** growth on edge index via `eu`/`ev` + `cap_bus`. |
| H3 | Growth skip | If both endpoints report same `cid`/`find` root → no growth. |
| H4 | Active predicate | `odd && !cluster_boundary` (Aether). |
| H5 | Union policy | Prefer **union-by-size** as in software; if adopting Helios min-cid, add equivalence tests on peeling outputs. |
| H6 | Syndrome bank | Read-only after ingest; peel FSM reads `syndrome`, writes correction bits / `obs_mask` XOR. **M38–M47:** PE-mesh solids → peel through Stim circuit d=3 r=3. |
| H7 | Peel root | If any boundary in component → that vertex is root; enqueue other degree-1 nodes (M10). **M38:** two_boundary_star on PE-mesh. **M41:** Helios-2 boundary peel after multiplex. |
| H8 | Controller | Tree OR-reduce of `busy` and `any_active`; single-clock domain. **M30:** comb OR-tree. **M31–M32:** wired into Blueprint grow/peel. **M33:** pipelined OR-tree `pipe_depth≡clog2(N)`. |
| H9 | Context switch | LUTRAM; **M39–M41** micro; **M67–M69** plan; **M70:** phys map 7 colors / 16 parts (`helios_n_coloring_m70.csv`); Helios schedule N_CTX≥16. |
| H10 | Host I/O | BRAM/URAM ring + obs egress; PCIe/UDP later (Phase 3). **M48–M53:** notes, phenom/circuit ring, **obs stub** (`aether_uf_obs_egress`). |
| H11 | Fallback | Unsolved / timeout → CPU MWPM; gate on measured rates. **M49:** notes. **M51/M54:** abort grids 0/400 on measured cells (`uf_decode_error_m51.csv`, `uf_decode_error_m54.csv`). |
| H12 | Co-sim | **M16–M28:** file Stim/Blueprint + DPI Blueprint + **DPI Stim** (circuit d=3 r=3 V=392 E=556). **M31–M32:** Blueprint grow/peel with H8 OR-tree ctrl (monolithic Stim path unchanged). |

