## 6. Corrections to older Aether docs

| Older claim | Correction |
| --- | --- |
| “Dual-port BRAM for PE clustering” (`Overview`) | PE state / context = **LUTRAM/regs** (Helios). BRAM for static DEM tables + host buffers. |
| “Each PE talks to 4 neighbors only” (`Analysis`) | True for a **code-capacity 2D lattice**; **false** for Stim circuit-level decoding graphs (high degree, many virtual boundaries). Degree comes from DEM, not from qubit grid. |
| “UF always O(V) on FPGA” | Helios worst-case cycle bound \(O(d^4)\); average can be ≪ 1 µs/round (published). Quote published numbers with noise model. |
| “10× Relay-BP vs BP+OSD on FPGA LUTs” (`Overview`) | Problem-dependent; see M13/M14. Relay-BP is a **separate** PE/message datapath. |

